{
  "uid": "keycloak",
  "title": "Keycloak",
  "description": "Keycloak activity, security auditing and runtime health.\n\nLogin activity is measured two ways, on purpose.\n\nThe metrics rows read keycloak_user_events_total from the Micrometer endpoint (:9000/metrics), enabled by KC_EVENT_METRICS_USER_ENABLED. These carry realm, idp and client_id, are cheap to query and follow the 15-day metric retention.\n\nThe audit row reads the org.keycloak.events log stream through Loki, enabled by KC_LOG_LEVEL=INFO,org.keycloak.events:debug. Only the log line carries source IP, username and session id \u2014 those are deliberately absent from the metrics to keep cardinality bounded \u2014 so brute-force and account-targeting analysis has to come from here. Log retention is 7 days.\n\nPerformance, JVM and database panels come from the Micrometer endpoint on :9000/metrics.",
  "tags": [
    "monitoring-stack",
    "keycloak",
    "security"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "weekStart": "",
  "preload": false,
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "type": "textbox",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "query": "keycloak",
        "current": {
          "text": "keycloak",
          "value": "keycloak"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "name": "pod",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Pod",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "victoriametrics"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{namespace=\"$namespace\"}, pod)",
          "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [],
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "type": "textbox",
        "label": "Search",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
